== Trivia ==
* Bumbo is the main character of his own game, [https://store.steampowered.com/app/1148650/The_Legend_of_BumBo/ The Legend of Bum-Bo], designed by Edmund McMillen.
* The name is a play on the word bum and Rambo.
* Bumbo Level 1 looks similar to Bum Friend's head.

